      "content": {
        "kind": "bundle",
        "sourceNeedCount": 5,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "summary",
            "heading": "Key ideas from this article",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Salary negotiation for freshers in India usually has real room, but it is smaller and more specific than most confident advice online suggests."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:1",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Fresher Is Negotiating Against Something Different",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "An HR recruiter offering a fresher role rarely has the authority to invent a new number outside the approved band on the spot."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "That means the honest question is not \"can I negotiate?\" - almost always, yes, in some form."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "how-much-room",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:4",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Advantage Check: When You Can Push Harder",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Before you decide how hard to push, run your situation through The Advantage Check - three honest signals that actually change how much a company is likely to move."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A second written offer, or a clear verbal one from a company that has already confirmed a number, is the strongest advantage a fresher can have."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A skill the role specifically needs, not just a skill you have"
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "advantage-check",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 4
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:5",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "What to Do When You Have None",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Most freshers reading this will not have a competing offer or a rare certification sitting in hand on the day the offer letter arrives."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Make your proof do the asking"
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A specific project, internship outcome, or piece of shipped work you can describe in one sentence carries more weight in a negotiation than a general claim about your potential."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "no-leverage",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 5
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:6",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Biggest Hesitation Most Freshers Have",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Timing matters as much as wording."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Raising it earlier, during interview rounds, usually gets deflected because no number has been approved yet."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "scripts",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 6
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:8",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Red Flags in a Fresher Offer",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Most fresher offers are exactly what they look like: a fair, standard band for the role."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The number is far below every source you checked"
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A single site running low is normal noise."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "red-flags",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 8
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "summary",
      "title": "How Much Room Do You Actually Have"
    },
